Generic single-database configuration.

Add a new revision:

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"

Apply pending migrations:

    uv run alembic upgrade head

The app also runs `alembic upgrade head` on startup as a fallback for the
internal-apps platform — until `pre_start_hooks` (app-platform#37) lands,
that's the only post-deploy migration hook.
